# Only PatchSmith's code goes into the repository: everything is ignored except what is listed below with "!".
# This way the data of whoever uses it (profiles, memory, logs, saves, configurations, settings...), the downloaded
# components (Ollama and the models, BepInEx, XUnity), the work folders and the generated files (PatchSmith.exe,
# the compiled plugins) never end up in it, not even by mistake.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.github/
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/LEGGIMI.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/PatchSmith.pyw
!/smith.py
!/patchsmith/
!/docs/
!/data/
!/test/
!/components/
/components/*
!/components/plugin/
/components/plugin/*
!/components/plugin/*.cs

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp
